{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/network/formula-to-condition-map/","title":"방제→질환·변증 지도","language":"ko-KR","description":"대표 방제를 변증·질환·증상과 연결해 임상적 맥락으로 탐색합니다.","text":"방제→질환·변증 지도\n보기·기혈쌍보\n사군자탕 → 기허·비위기허\n육군자탕 → 비위기허 + 담음\n보중익기탕 → 중기하함·기허\n귀비탕 → 심비양허·불면·심계\n십전대보탕 → 기혈양허·허약\n허손·회복\n공진단 → 허손·피로·회복\n경옥고 → 기음·양생·회복\n생맥산 → 기음양허·진액 소모\n담음·소화기\n온담탕 → 담음·담위불화·불면\n육군자탕 → 기능성 소화불량·비위기허\n근골격계\n독활기생탕 → 풍한습비 + 간신·기혈허\n고방\n계지탕 → 태양중풍·영위불화\n마황탕 → 태양상한·표실\n소청룡탕 → 표증 + 수음\n소시호탕 → 소양병\n오령산 → 수기불리\n→ 통합 한의학 지식 그래프","headings":[{"level":2,"title":"보기·기혈쌍보","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/network/formula-to-condition-map/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"허손·회복","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/network/formula-to-condition-map/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"담음·소화기","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/network/formula-to-condition-map/#_4"},{"level":2,"title":"근골격계","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/network/formula-to-condition-map/#_5"},{"level":2,"title":"고방","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/network/formula-to-condition-map/#_6"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/buzhong-yiqi-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/duhuo-jisheng-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/gongjin-dan/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/guibi-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/guizhi-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/gyeongok-go/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/liujunzi-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/mahuang-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/shengmai-san/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/shi-quan-da-bu-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/sijunzi-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/wendan-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/wuling-san/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/xiaochaihu-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/xiaoqinglong-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/network/integrated-knowledge-graph/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and